			<div class="content" id="post-content-4765439">
									

<p>This piece feels like a diluted re-telling of <a href="/scp-1322">SCP-1322</a> with unnecessary banana-flavoring. While I will admit I am disturbed by the notion of flies burrowing through ones flesh, the fact that it's, for what I can only assume is wackiness's sake, <em>banana</em> flesh only serves to distract from both the body horror and from the emotional impact of the pandemic. I also wasn't particularly a fan of the way the journal was written, which felt kitschy and somewhat plodding.</p>

							</div>

								
					
