			<div class="content" id="post-content-4765447">
									

<p>All fair points. The reason for the banana people was not purely wackiness, though. I wanted the threat to be something completely unanomalous and ordinary, like fruit flies, which are possibly one of the most least threatening insects on the planet. Flies don't eat people though, so the people had to be fruits. I can, however, see why it might seem too nonsensical and take away from the story.</p>

